--- PRC-06, 07, 08, 09: directory remove, nonrecursive refusal ---
a text called 'the inbox' is "{'the workspace'}/procouter1".
a text called 'the inbox inner path' is "{'the workspace'}/procouter1/inner".
Create a directory called 'the inbox'.
Create a directory called 'the inbox inner path'.
a boolean called 'the inbox refused' is false.
Remove the directory called 'the inbox'.
On error Set 'the inbox refused' to true.
If 'the inbox refused' is false then, Print "ASSERT PRC-09: expected 1 got {'the inbox refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'the inbox refused'.
If 'the inbox inner path' is not available then, Print "ASSERT PRC-09: expected available got missing", Exit 95. Print "survived".
Remove the directory called 'the inbox inner path'.
Remove the directory called 'the inbox'.
If 'the inbox' is not available then, Print "ASSERT PRC-08: expected missing got available", Exit 95. Print "removed".

