On error Set 'the register refused' to true.
If 'the register refused' is false then, Print "ASSERT PRC-09: expected 1 got {'the register refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'the register refused'.
If 'the register inner path' is not available then, Print "ASSERT PRC-09: expected available got missing", Exit 95. Print "survived".
Delete directory called 'the register inner path'.
