If 'the register' is not available then, Print "ASSERT PRC-08: expected missing got available", Exit 95. Print "removed".

--- PRC-12, 13, 21: mount/unmount refusal ---
a text called 'the dispatch note' is "{'the workspace'}/procmount1".
Create a directory called 'the dispatch note'.
a boolean called 'the dispatch note mount refused' is false.
Mount 'the dispatch note' at 'the dispatch note' with type "tmpfs".
On error Set 'the dispatch note mount refused' to true.
If 'the dispatch note mount refused' is false then, Print "ASSERT PRC-12: expected 1 got {'the dispatch note mount refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'the dispatch note mount refused'.
a boolean called 'the dispatch note unmount refused' is false.
Unmount 'the dispatch note'.
On error Set 'the dispatch note unmount refused' to true.
If 'the dispatch note unmount refused' is false then, Print "ASSERT PRC-21: expected 1 got {'the dispatch note unmount refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'the dispatch note unmount refused'.
Remove the directory called 'the dispatch note'.

