a number called 'loading bay exec exit code' is the reaped status divide 256 modulo 256.
If 'loading bay exec exit code' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT PRC-33: expected 0 got {'loading bay exec exit code'}", Exit 95. Print 'loading bay exec exit code'.

